  <metadata>
    <n>2 Day / 1 Night Rinjani Summit Trek — Sembalun Loop</n>
    <desc>GPS-verified route data for the 2 Day / 1 Night Mount Rinjani Summit Trek (Sembalun Loop). Field-recorded by Rinjani Dawn Adventures guides on active treks. Total distance: 25.79km. Elevation gain: +3,145m. Summit: 3,726m. Book this trek: https://rinjanidawnadventures.com/tour/mt-rinjani-summit-trek-lombok-2-day/</desc>
    <author>
      <n>Rinjani Dawn Adventures</n>
      <name>Rinjani Dawn Adventures</name>
    </author>
    <name>2 Day / 1 Night Mount Rinjani Summit Trek — Sembalun Loop</name>
    <link href="https://rinjanidawnadventures.com/tour/mt-rinjani-summit-trek-lombok-2-day/">
      <text>Book this trek — Rinjani Dawn Adventures</text>
